PHP2Shell Checker para Claude Code

This project is a modified version of php2shell-checker
(https://github.com/openai/php2shell-checker), Copyright OpenAI,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original:
- Packaged as a Claude Code plugin and marketplace (.claude-plugin/).
- Renamed skills phpcheck-url and phpcheck-server to url and server, with
  Claude Code frontmatter (argument-hint, allowed-tools) and
  ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR} paths.
- Expanded skill instructions (redirects, PHP-FPM vs CLI, distribution
  packages, authorization).
- Moved tests to test/ and added package.json.
- Rewrote README in Spanish; added CHANGELOG.

The checker script (skills/url/scripts/phpcheck.js) is unchanged.
